  "design": {
    "entrance": "The extruded gold title glides forward from depth while turning from a three-quarter angle to face the lens (yaw -38 deg to 0) under a slow, elegant camera push.",
    "reveal": "As it squares up a warm key light blooms behind it; a single narrow specular highlight travels across the bevels; a star glint catches one serif.",
    "camera": "Continuous slow push-in with a gentle low-angle tilt that levels out; a whisper of settle at the lock.",
    "material": "Polished gold (Blinn, high specular exponent) with warm-neutral environment reflection, dark horizon band, crisp rounded bevel and darker extruded sides; glossy floor reflection.",
    "exit": "The title turns away on its vertical axis and recedes while the key light dims to black."
  },
